---
const linkColumns = [
  {
    title: 'Marca',
    links: [
      { label: 'Catálogo', href: '/#catalogo' },
      { label: 'Sobre Nosotros', href: '/sobre-nosotros' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Ayuda',
    links: [
      { label: 'Contacto (WhatsApp)', href: 'https://wa.me/573228369024', external: true },
      { label: 'Términos', href: '/terminos' },
      { label: 'Privacidad', href: '/privacidad' },
    ],
  },
];
---

<footer style="background:#31312b; color:#f4f0e7;" class="mt-24 pt-20 pb-10 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 mb-16">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div class="col-span-1">
        <span style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; color:#ffd9e2; font-size:1.375rem; font-weight:800;">
          lananegra
        </span>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4 mb-6" style="color:#d4c2c5;">
          Amigurumis tejidos a mano con amor. Cada compañero lleva horas de dedicación y un toque de magia artesanal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Links -->
      {linkColumns.map(col => (
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold mb-5 uppercase tracking-wider" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; color:#ffffff; letter-spacing:0.08em;">
            {col.title}
          </h4>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            {col.links.map(link => (
              <li>
                {link.external ? (
                  <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link">{link.label}</a>
                ) : (
                  <a href={link.href} class="footer-link">{link.label}</a>
                )}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(244,240,231,0.1); color:rgba(244,240,231,0.6);">
      <p>© 2026 lananegra. Tejido con amor.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="/terminos" style="color:inherit; text-decoration:none;" class="hover:underline">Términos</a>
        <a href="/privacidad" style="color:inherit; text-decoration:none;" class="hover:underline">Privacidad</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-link {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #d4c2c5;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .footer-link:hover { color: #ffffff; transform: translateX(3px); }
</style>
